Value Required NAME (\S+)
Value RD (\S+)
Value PROTOCOLS (\S+)
Value VRF_ID (\d+)

Start
  ^Name\s+Default\s+RD -> Records
  ^VRF\s+Name\s+RD -> Records
  ^-+
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Start

Records
  ^${NAME}\s+${RD}\s+${PROTOCOLS}\s+${VRF_ID}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${NAME}\s+${RD}\s+${PROTOCOLS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${NAME}\s+${RD}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^-+
  ^Total
  ^\s*$$
  ^\S+\s*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.* -> Records
